  READING: if the naive embed clears 1/14 when slack/2 > coupling error (Vmax >> spread), the
  embedding is clean there; if Vmax~spread the coupling error may exceed slack (the hard case).
  BEST-tau-in-cell tells whether SOME tau in the ruler cell realizes loneliness (existence of embed).
